globalThis.IQLocalePacks=globalThis.IQLocalePacks||{};globalThis.IQLocalePacks.yo={"code":"yo","messages":{"Estimated median range":"Ààlà àárín tí a fojú díwọ̀n","Public comparisons include all contributors using this puzzle version. Optional age group and country are only used in private aggregate statistics.":"Àwọn ìfiwéra ní gbangba ní nínú gbogbo àwọn tí wọ́n kópa nípa lílo ẹ̀yà eré ìdánilẹ́kọ̀ọ́ yìí. Ìwífún nípa ẹgbẹ́ ọjọ́-orí àti orílẹ̀-èdè—tí ó jẹ́ àṣàyàn—ni a ó lò nìkan fún àkójọ àwọn ìṣirò tí kò fi ẹni kọ̀ọ̀kan hàn ní pàtó.","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results, active times and any optional age group or country to aggregate statistics.":"Mo gba láti fi àwọn àbájáde ìbéèrè mi (láìfi orúkọ mi hàn), àkókò tí mo lò, àti ẹgbẹ́ ọjọ́-orí tàbí orílẹ̀-èdè mi (tí mo bá fẹ́ fi kún un) sínú àkójọ àwọn ìṣirò gbogbogbò.","Median ranges are estimated from time histograms. The displayed interval shows the timing resolution; no exact median or speed percentile is claimed.":"A fojú díwọ̀n ààlà àárín láti inú àwọn àwòrán ìṣirò àkókò (histograms). Ààlà tí a fi hàn yìí dúró fún ìwọ̀n àkókò tí a lò; a kò sọ pé ó jẹ́ àárín gangan tàbí ìwọ̀n pàtó kan nínú ìyára.","Share the challenge":"Pín ìpèníjà yìí","Question time":"Àkókò ìbéèrè","Your browser privacy preferences keep these statistics on your device.":"Àwọn ètò ìpamọ́ nínú ẹ̀rọ ìwò-wẹ́ẹ̀bù (browser) rẹ mú kí àwọn ìṣirò wọ̀nyí wà lórí ẹ̀rọ rẹ nìkan.","All voluntary attempts":"Gbogbo ìgbìyànjú tí a ṣe ní ti ara ẹni","Thank you. Your anonymous contribution was saved.":"Ẹ ṣeun. A ti fi àfikún rẹ—láìfi orúkọ rẹ hàn—pamọ́.","There are not enough comparable attempts in this group yet. Your own statistics are always available.":"Kò tíì sí ìgbìyànjú tó pọ̀ tó láti fi wé ti ẹlòmíràn nínú ẹgbẹ́ yìí. Àwọn ìṣirò tirẹ wà nílẹ̀ nígbà gbogbo.","Comparisons are temporarily unavailable. Your own statistics and sharing still work.":"Àwọn ìfiwéra kò sí nílẹ̀ fún ìgbà díẹ̀. Àwọn ìṣirò tirẹ àti agbára láti pín àbájáde rẹ ṣì wà nílẹ̀.","This older attempt has no complete timing record. You can still explore and share your result.":"Ìgbìyànjú àtijọ́ yìí kò ní àkọsílẹ̀ àkókò tó péye. Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, o ṣì lè wo àbájáde rẹ kí o sì pín ín.","Choose whether to contribute before sending any data.":"Ṣe àṣàyàn bóyá o fẹ́ kópa kí o tó fi àwọn ìwífún èyíkéyìí ránṣẹ́.","This attempt has no complete timing record. Your personal results are unchanged.":"Ìgbìyànjú yìí kò ní àkọsílẹ̀ àkókò tó péye. Àwọn àbájáde tirẹ kò yí padà.","Your contribution could not be saved in this browser. Nothing was sent.":"A kò lè fi àfikún rẹ pamọ́ nínú ẹ̀rọ ìwò-wẹ́ẹ̀bù yìí. Kò sí ohun tí a fi ránṣẹ́.","This contribution needs review and was not counted again.":"Àfikún yìí nílò àyẹ̀wò, nítorí náà a kò kà á mọ́ àpapọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.","Your contribution has not been confirmed. Try again with the same saved contribution.":"A kò tíì fọwọ́ sí àfikún rẹ. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i pẹ̀lú àfikún kan náà tí o ti fi pamọ́ tẹ́lẹ̀.","No account needed":"Ko nilo akọọlẹ kankan","The test starts when you are ready":"Idanwo naa yoo bẹrẹ nigbati o ba ti ṣetan","Test":"Idanwo","Answered questions":"Awọn ibeere ti a ti dahun","Something to share":"Nkan lati pin","Your strongest moment":"Akoko ti o lagbara julọ rẹ","Your estimated IQ":"Iṣiro IQ rẹ","A tricky puzzle, solved quickly":"Ìṣòro ti o nira, ti a yanju ni kiakia","Quicker than the typical correct answer":"Yiyara ju bi a ṣe n fun idahun ti o tọ lọ deede","Your quickest correct answer":"Idahun ti o tọ ti o yara julọ rẹ","Patterns you solved":"Awọn ilana ti o yanju","A challenge worth sharing":"Ipenija ti o tọ si pinpin","36 puzzles. One challenge.":"Awọn ìṣòro 36. Ipenija kan.","Share a challenge with someone you know.":"Pin ipenija kan pẹlu ẹnikan ti o mọ.","Your own active time. There is not enough comparison data to rank its speed.":"Akoko ti o lo. Ko si data afiwera to peye lati ṣe iwọn iyara rẹ.","Choose what to share":"Yan ohun ti o fẹ pin","Best moment":"Akoko ti o dara julọ","IQ estimate":"Iṣiro IQ","Correct patterns":"Awọn ilana ti o tọ","Share on Facebook":"Pin lori Facebook","Copy a personal caption":"Daakọ ọrọ apejuwe ti ara ẹni","Your share text":"Ọrọ ti iwọ yoo pin","Copy text":"Daakọ ọrọ naa","Facebook lets you write your own caption. We never post automatically.":"Facebook gba ọ laaye lati kọ ọrọ apejuwe tirẹ. A ko ni fi nkan ranṣẹ laifọwọyi rara.","Copied. Paste it into your post.":"A ti daakọ rẹ. Lẹẹmọ ọ sinu ifiweranṣẹ rẹ.","Select and copy the text below.":"Yan ki o si daakọ ọrọ ti o wa ni isalẹ.","Your question statistics":"Awọn iṣiro nipa awọn ibeere rẹ","Question comparisons are not available yet. Your personal statistics are shown below.":"Ko si awọn afiwera ibeere ni bayi. Awọn iṣiro ti ara ẹni rẹ han ni isalẹ.","Times count visible, focused question time up to your last answer. For unanswered questions, time spent is shown. Hidden tabs and closed pages do not count. Earlier attempts may have no timings.":"Akoko ti a ka ni akoko ti o lo gangan lori ibeere kan titi di igba ti o fi fun idahun rẹ ti o kẹhin. Fun awọn ibeere ti a ko dahun, akoko ti a lo lori wọn ni a fihan. Awọn taabu ti o farasin tabi awọn oju-iwe ti a ti ti ko ni ka sinu akoko yii. Awọn igbiyanju iṣaaju le ma ni akoko ti a gbasilẹ.","All 36 questions, including skipped questions":"Gbogbo awọn ibeere 36, pẹlu awọn ti o fo kọja","Question":"Ibeere","Your time":"Akoko rẹ","Correct-answer median":"Iye aarin (median) fun awọn idahun ti o tọ","Others correct":"Awọn miiran ti o dahun ni deede","Compare with voluntary attempts using the same puzzle version. At least 30 answered questions are needed for a correct rate, and 30 timed correct answers for a median. These are participants, not a representative population.":"Ṣe afiwe pẹlu awọn igbiyanju ti awọn eniyan ṣe ni ifẹ inu wọn, nipa lilo ẹya ere-ọpọlọ (puzzle) kanna. O kere ju awọn ibeere 30 ti a dahun ni a nilo lati pinnu oṣuwọn deede, ati awọn idahun ti o tọ 30 ti o ni akoko ti a gbasilẹ lati pinnu iye aarin (median). Awọn wọnyi jẹ awọn olukopa, kii ṣe aṣoju gbogbo olugbe.","Compare and contribute":"Ṣe afiwe ki o si ṣe alabapin","Help future participants compare their results. You can share anonymous test statistics after finishing, even if you skipped questions.":"Ran awọn olukopa ọjọ iwaju lọwọ lati ṣe afiwe awọn abajade wọn. O le pin awọn iṣiro idanwo laisi ifihan orukọ rẹ lẹhin ti o ba pari, paapaa ti o ba fo diẹ ninu awọn ibeere kọja.","Anonymous comparisons are being prepared. Your personal statistics and sharing work without contributing.":"A n pese awọn afiwe ti ko ni orukọ. Awọn iṣiro ti ara ẹni rẹ ati pinpin wọn wa laisi dandan lati ṣe alabapin si data gbogbogbo.","Age group (optional)":"Ẹgbẹ ọjọ-ori (aṣayan)","Country (optional)":"Orilẹ-ede (aṣayan)","Prefer not to say":"Fẹ lati ma sọ","Under 18":"Labẹ ọdun 18","I agree to contribute my anonymous question results and active times, together with any age group and country I choose, to comparison statistics.":"Mo gba lati ṣe alabapin awọn abajade ibeere mi (laisi orukọ) ati akoko ti mo lo, pẹlu ẹgbẹ ọjọ-ori ati orilẹ-ede ti mo yan, si awọn iṣiro afiwe.","No name, email or exact age. Sharing your statistics is optional and does not affect your result. Small comparison groups are hidden.":"Ko si orukọ, imeeli, tabi ọjọ-ori gangan. Pinpin awọn iṣiro rẹ jẹ aṣayan, ko si ni ipa lori abajade rẹ. Awọn ẹgbẹ afiwe ti o kere pupọ ni a fi pamọ.","Contribute anonymously":"Ṣe alabapin laisi ifihan orukọ","Why this answer?":"Kilode ti idahun yii?","Explanation":"Alaye","The rule":"Ofin naa","Applying the rule":"Lilo ofin naa","You are reviewing an older puzzle version. Its examples contain the previously identified ambiguity; your saved answer and score are unchanged.":"O n wo ẹya ere-ọpọlọ (puzzle) ti o ti pẹ diẹ. Awọn apẹẹrẹ ninu rẹ ni aisi-daju (ambiguity) ti a ti ṣe akiyesi tẹlẹ; idahun ati ami ti o ti fipamọ ko yipada.","You are reviewing the original version, which contained incorrect example markers. Your saved answer and score are unchanged. New attempts use the corrected version.":"O n wo ẹya atilẹba, eyiti o ni awọn ami apẹẹrẹ ti ko tọ. Idahun ati ami ti o ti fipamọ ko yipada. Àwọn ìgbìyànjú tuntun máa ń lo ẹ̀yà tí a ti ṣàtúnṣe.","In this original version, the displayed middle picture expands to green at the top right and row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3 and row 4, column 3.":"Nínú ẹ̀yà àkọ́kọ́ yìí, àwòrán tí ó wà láàrin yóò yípadà sí àwọ̀ ewé ní ​​apá òkè ní ọ̀tún, ní ìlà kejì, òpó kẹta; sí àwọ̀ pupa ní ìlà kejì, òpó kìíní; àti sí àwọ̀ ilẹ̀ (brown) ní ìlà kejì, òpó kejì; ìlà kẹta, òpó kẹta; àti ìlà kẹrin, òpó kẹta.","Share result on Facebook":"Pín àbájáde náà lórí Facebook","Share test on Facebook":"Pin idanwo naa lori Facebook","Estimated IQ":"Iṣiro IQ","Just for fun. An approximate score, not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Fun igbadun nikan. Eyi jẹ iṣiro isunmọ, kii ṣe iwọn IQ ti a fọwọsi nipasẹ awọn amoye.","Your test is incomplete. Your correct answers are shown, but an IQ estimate needs all 36 answers.":"Idanwo rẹ ko pari. Awọn idahun ti o tọ han, ṣugbọn lati ṣe iṣiro IQ, gbogbo awọn idahun 36 ni a nilo.","Unavailable":"Ko si","Free visual reasoning test | IQ Champion":"Idanwo ọfẹ lori agbara ironu nipasẹ wiwo | IQ Champion","36 visual reasoning puzzles. Take a free 40-minute challenge and explore your results.":"Awọn ibeere ironu wiwo 36. Kopa ninu idanwo ọfẹ ti o gba iṣẹju 40 ki o si wo awọn abajade rẹ.","Answered":"Ti a dahun","Unanswered":"Ti a ko dahun","Correct":"O tọ","Incorrect":"Ko tọ","Close":"Pa","Help":"Iranlọwọ","40 min":"Iṣẹju 40","Language":"Ede","About the test":"Nipa idanwo naa","A challenge in visual reasoning":"Idanwo lori agbara ironu wiwo","Spot the pattern.":"Wa ilana ti o wa ninu rẹ.","Find the missing piece.":"Wa apakan ti o sonu.","36 visual puzzles and an estimated IQ score. Just for fun.":"Awọn ibeere wiwo 36 ati iṣiro IQ. Fun igbadun nikan.","Puzzles":"Awọn ibeere","Time limit":"Akoko ti a pin","Cost":"Iye owo","Free":"Ọfẹ","No account needed. The timer starts when you begin.":"Ko nilo akọọlẹ kankan. Aago yoo bẹrẹ ni kete ti o ba bẹrẹ idanwo naa.","How the test works":"Bi idanwo naa ṣe n ṣiṣẹ","Choose the icon that completes each pattern.":"Yan aami ti o pari ilana kọọkan.","Skip tricky questions and return using the overview.":"O le fo awọn ibeere ti o nira kọja ki o pada si wọn nipasẹ atokọ gbogbogbo.","Review or change your answers before you finish.":"Ṣayẹwo tabi yi awọn idahun rẹ pada ṣaaju ki o to pari.","Your answers and start time are saved in this browser. Reloading keeps your original deadline.":"Awọn idahun rẹ ati akoko ti o bẹrẹ ti wa ni fipamọ sinu ẹrọ aṣawakiri yii. Ti o ba tun oju-iwe yii ṣe (reload), akoko ipari atilẹba rẹ yoo wa bi o ti ri.","The 40-minute timer continues while the page is closed. Unanswered questions count as incorrect.":"Aago iṣẹju 40 naa yoo tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ paapaa ti o ba ti pa oju-iwe naa. Awọn ibeere ti a ko dahun yoo ka bi awọn ti ko tọ.","About your result":"Nipa abajade rẹ","Your estimated IQ is based on your position among":"Iṣiro IQ rẹ da lori ipo rẹ laarin","historical attempts.":"awọn igbiyanju ti a ti ṣe tẹlẹ.","The comparison uses attempts lasting over one minute and up to 40 minutes. It has not been validated against an official IQ test or a representative population sample.":"Ifiwera yii lo awọn igbiyanju ti o gba akoko ti o ju iṣẹju kan lọ, titi de iṣẹju 40. Ko tii jẹrisi nipasẹ idanwo IQ osise tabi nipasẹ ẹgbẹ eniyan ti o ṣoju fun gbogbo olugbe.","A test for fun. Your estimated IQ is an approximation, not a professionally validated IQ score.":"Idanwo fun igbadun. Iṣiro IQ rẹ jẹ ifoju-niwọn nikan; kii ṣe abajade IQ ti a fọwọsi nipasẹ awọn amoye.","Start 40-minute test":"Bẹrẹ idanwo iṣẹju 40","Reasoning test":"Idanwo agbara ironu","Your challenge":"Ipenija rẹ","Time remaining":"Akoko ti o ku","remaining":"ti o ku","Question pattern":"Ilana awọn ibeere","Find the pattern":"Wa ilana naa","Four rows of visual patterns; complete the last row":"Awọn ila mẹrin ti awọn apẹrẹ wiwo; pari ila ti o kẹhin","Choose your answer":"Yan idahun rẹ","Question navigation":"Lilọ kiri laarin awọn ibeere","Previous question":"Ibeere ti tẹlẹ","Skip for now":"Fi silẹ fun igba diẹ","Next question":"Ibeere ti o tẹle","Question overview":"Akopọ awọn ibeere","✓ Answered":"✓ Ti dahun","○ Unanswered":"○ Ko tii dahun","Outline = current":"Aami = ibeere lọwọlọwọ","Jump to a question":"Lọ si ibeere kan pato","Review and finish":"Ṣayẹwo ki o pari","Instructions & saved progress":"Awọn ilana & ilọsiwaju ti a ti fipamọ","Pick an answer to move to the next unanswered question. You can skip, return and change answers before finishing.":"Yan idahun kan lati lọ si ibeere ti o tẹle ti a ko tii dahun. O le fo ibeere kan kọja, pada sẹhin, ki o si yi awọn idahun rẹ pada ki o to pari.","Answers save automatically in this browser. Reloading resumes the same question; your timer keeps running.":"Awọn idahun rẹ n fipamọ funrararẹ ninu ẹrọ aṣawakiri yii. Ti o ba tun oju-iwe naa ṣe (reload), iwọ yoo pada si ibeere kanna; aago rẹ yoo si tẹsiwaju lati ṣiṣẹ.","Ready when you are":"A ti ṣetan nigbakugba ti iwọ ba ṣetan","Finish this test?":"Ṣe o fẹ pari idanwo yii?","Keep working":"Tẹsiwaju pẹlu iṣẹ rẹ","Finish and see result":"Pari ki o si wo abajade rẹ","Challenge complete":"Ipenija ti pari","Your result":"Abajade rẹ","Review answers":"Ṣayẹwo awọn idahun rẹ","Try again":"Gbiyanju lẹẹkansi","About this test":"Nipa idanwo yii","How to read this result":"Bi a ṣe le tumọ abajade yii","Your percentile among historical attempts is converted to the familiar IQ scale: midpoint 100 and standard deviation 15. This assumes the comparison group reflects the population, which has not been established.":"Ipo rẹ (percentile) laarin awọn ti o ti ṣe idanwo yii tẹlẹ ti wa ni yiyipada si iwọn IQ ti a mọ daradara: aarin rẹ jẹ 100, pẹlu iyapa boṣewa (standard deviation) ti 15. Eyi da lori ero pe ẹgbẹ ti a n fi ọwewe rẹ pẹlu wọn duro fun gbogbo eniyan ni apapọ, eyi ti ko tii jẹrisi ni kikun.","Your answers, explained":"Awọn idahun rẹ, pẹlu alaye","Review your answers":"Ṣayẹwo awọn idahun rẹ","Back to result":"Pada si abajade","The pattern":"Ilana naa","Compare the answers":"Fi awọn idahun wewe pọ","Your answer":"Idahun rẹ","Correct answer":"Idahun ti o tọ","Previous review question":"Ibeere ti tẹlẹ","Next review question":"Ibeere ti o tẹle","Results by question":"Awọn abajade fun ibeere kọọkan","Explore all 36 puzzles":"Ṣawari gbogbo awọn ibeere/ipenija 36 naa","✓ Correct":"✓ O tọ","× Incorrect":"× Ko tọ","Review a question":"Ṣayẹwo ibeere kan","Your submitted answers and final score stay unchanged.":"Awọn idahun ti o ti fi silẹ ati ami ikẹhin rẹ yoo wa bi wọn ṣe wa, wọn ko ni yipada.","Contact":"Kan si wa","Feedback & contact":"Èsì & kan si wa","Send feedback or contact us":"Fi èsì ranṣẹ tabi kan si wa","Correct. Your answer matches the correct answer.":"O tọ. Idahun rẹ ba idahun ti o tọ mu.","Incorrect. Your answer differs from the correct answer.":"Ko tọ. Idahun rẹ yatọ si idahun ti o tọ.","Unanswered. No answer was submitted for this question.":"Ko si idahun. Ko si idahun ti a fi silẹ fun ibeere yii.","No answer submitted":"Ko si idahun ti a fi silẹ","Your submitted answer":"Idahun ti o fi silẹ","Missing icon":"Aami ti o sonu","All questions are answered. You can still review and change answers, then finish the test.":"Gbogbo awọn ibeere ni a ti dahun. O tun le ṣayẹwo ki o si yi awọn idahun pada, lẹhinna pari idanwo naa.","Five minutes or less remaining.":"Iṣẹju marun tabi kere si lo ku.","Time is up. Your answers have been scored.":"Akoko ti pari. A ti fun awọn idahun rẹ ni ami.","Test completed.":"Idanwo ti pari.","Comparison unavailable.":"Ko si ifiwera.","This browser could not save your attempt. Keep this page open: reloading may lose progress or restore older answers.":"Ẹrọ aṣawakiri yii ko le fipamọ igbiyanju rẹ. Jẹ ki oju-iwe yii wa ni ṣiṣi: tun oju-iwe naa ṣe (reload) le fa ki o padanu iṣẹ ti o ti ṣe tẹlẹ tabi mu awọn idahun atijọ pada wa.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. Keep this page open to avoid losing your attempt.":"Ko ṣee ṣe lati fipamọ data si ẹrọ aṣawakiri yii. Jẹ ki oju-iwe yii wa ni ṣiṣi lati yago fun pipadanu igbiyanju rẹ.","The saved attempt could not be restored. Start a new test when you are ready.":"Ko ṣee ṣe lati mu igbiyanju ti a fipamọ pada wa. Bẹrẹ idanwo tuntun nigbati o ba ti ṣetan.","Keep the figure unchanged":"Ma ṣe yi nọmba naa pada","Every position in each example row contains the same blue circle. Neither the shape, colour nor size changes.":"Gbogbo ipo ninu ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan awọn ila apẹẹrẹ ni o ni iyika buluu kan naa. Boya apẹrẹ, awọ, tabi iwọn rẹ̀ ko yipada.","The last row already contains two identical blue circles. Another identical blue circle completes it.":"Ila ti o kẹhin ti ni awọn iyika buluu meji ti o jọra tẹlẹ. Iyika buluu miiran ti o jọra si wọn ni o pari rẹ̀.","Add one nested outline":"Fi apẹrẹ kan kun si inu ekeji","Moving right adds a smaller outline of the same shape inside the previous one. The outer shape and its colour stay unchanged.":"Bi a ba lọ si apa ọtun, apẹrẹ kekere kan ti o ni irisi kanna yoo han si inu apẹrẹ ti o wa tẹlẹ. Apẹrẹ ti ita ati awọ rẹ̀ ko yipada.","The green triangle has one inner triangle in the middle position. Add one more, smaller inner triangle to obtain the answer.":"Onigun mẹta alawọ ewe naa ni onigun mẹta miiran ninu rẹ̀ ni aarin. Fi onigun mẹta kekere miiran kun si inu rẹ̀ lati gba idahun naa.","Use the first shape as a cut-out":"Lo apẹrẹ akọkọ gẹgẹbi ohun elo lati ge nkan kuro","The black shape in the first position is removed from the centre of the coloured square in the second position. The hole is white.":"Apẹrẹ dudu ti o wa ni ipo akọkọ ni a ti yọ kuro ni aarin onigun mẹrin ti o ni awọ ti o wa ni ipo keji. Iho ti o ṣẹda jẹ funfun.","The black square makes a square hole in the green square. Choose the green square with the white square opening.":"Onigun mẹrin dudu naa ṣẹda iho onigun mẹrin ninu onigun mẹrin alawọ ewe naa. Yan onigun mẹrin alawọ ewe ti o ni iho onigun mẹrin funfun ninu rẹ̀.","Combine the upper and lower colours":"Darapọ awọn awọ ti o wa loke ati ti o wa ni isalẹ","The result takes its upper half from the first capsule and its lower half from the second capsule.":"Abajade naa gba idaji oke rẹ̀ lati inu apẹrẹ akọkọ, ati idaji isalẹ rẹ̀ lati inu apẹrẹ keji.","The first capsule is white and the second is blue, so the result is white above and blue below.":"Apẹrẹ akọkọ jẹ funfun, ekeji si jẹ buluu; nitorinaa, abajade naa jẹ funfun ni oke ati buluu ni isalẹ.","Rotate the coloured lobes":"Yi awọn apakan ti o ni awọ naa pada","At each step, turn the whole four-lobed figure 90 degrees clockwise. Every red and blue lobe moves with the figure.":"Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, yi gbogbo apẹrẹ ti o ni awọn apakan mẹrin naa pada ni iwọn 90 ni itọsọna ti aago n lọ. Gbogbo awọn apakan pupa ati buluu n yi pẹlu apẹrẹ naa.","Turn the middle figure another quarter-turn clockwise. The two red lobes finish on the right and at the bottom; the top and left lobes are blue.":"Yi apẹrẹ ti o wa ni aarin pada siwaju sii ni iwọn idamẹrin iyipo kan ni itọsọna ti aago n lọ. Awọn apakan pupa meji naa yoo wa ni apa ọtun ati ni isalẹ; awọn apakan ti o wa ni oke ati apa osi yoo jẹ buluu.","Round the corners progressively":"Sọ awọn igun di yika diẹdiẹ","The colour and general shape remain the same while the corners become more rounded at each step.":"Awọ ati apẹrẹ gbogbogbo ko yipada, ṣugbọn awọn igun naa n di yika si i ni igbesẹ kọọkan.","Continue rounding the corners of the brown rectangle. The answer is the brown capsule with fully rounded ends.":"Tẹ̀síwájú láti yí àwọn igun onígun mẹ́rin aláwọ̀ ilẹ̀ náà padà sí àwọn apá tí ó yípo. Àbájáde rẹ̀ yóò jẹ́ àpẹ́rú aláwọ̀ ilẹ̀ tí ó ní àwọn òpin tí ó yípo pátápátá.","Continue the circle’s movement":"Tẹ̀síwájú pẹ̀lú ìgbéṣẹ̀ yíyípo náà.","Within each row the green circle moves the same distance in the same direction: upward, downward or horizontally. Its size stays fixed.":"Nínú ìlà kọ̀ọ̀kan, yíyípo aláwọ̀ ewé náà máa ń gbe ní ìwọ̀n kan náà sí ìtọ́sọ́nà kan náà: sí òkè, sí ìsàlẹ̀, tàbí ní ìtọ́sọ́nà pẹ́lẹ́bẹ. Títóbi rẹ̀ kò yí padà.","In the last row the circle moves left along the bottom of the square. One more equal step places it at the bottom left.":"Nínú ìlà tó kẹ́yìn, yíyípo náà ń gbe lọ sí apá òsì ní ìsàlẹ̀ onígun mẹ́rin náà. Ìgbéṣẹ̀ kan sí i yóò gbé e sí apá ìsàlẹ̀ ní apá òsì.","Turn the entire dot pattern":"Yí gbogbo ètò àwọn àmì náà padà.","Rotate the square and all its dots 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. The square becomes a diamond, then a square again.":"Yi onigun mẹrin naa ati gbogbo awọn aami inu rẹ pada ni iwọn 45 si apa idakeji aago ni igbesẹ kọọkan. Onigun mẹrin naa yoo di apẹrẹ onigun-diamond, lẹhinna o tun pada di onigun mẹrin lẹẹkansi.","Turn the middle green-and-black diamond another 45 degrees counterclockwise. Keep the green and black dots in their rotated positions.":"Yi apẹrẹ onigun-diamond alawọ ewe ati dudu ti o wa ni aarin pada ni iwọn 45 miiran si apa idakeji aago. Jẹ ki awọn aami alawọ ewe ati dudu duro ni ipo ti wọn wa lẹhin yiyi wọn.","Shorten each bar from the top":"Dinku gigun ọpa kọọkan lati oke.","At every step, each vertical black bar loses one grid interval from its upper end. Its lower end stays on the bottom line. A bar disappears when its length reaches zero.":"Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, ọpa dudu ti o duro ni inaro yoo dinku nipasẹ aaye kan lati opin oke rẹ. Opin isalẹ rẹ yoo wa ni ipo kanna lori laini isalẹ. Ọpa naa yoo parẹ patapata nigbati gigun rẹ ba di odo.","The middle picture has a one-interval middle bar and a two-interval right bar. The middle bar disappears, leaving a one-interval bar on the right.":"Aworan ti o wa ni aarin ni ọpa aarin ti o ni gigun aaye kan, ati ọpa apa ọtun ti o ni gigun aaye meji. Ọpa aarin naa yoo parẹ, ti yoo fi ọpa ti o ni gigun aaye kan silẹ ni apa ọtun.","Reflect across the black line":"Ṣe afihan apẹrẹ naa ni apa keji laini dudu naa.","The middle line is a mirror axis. Reflect the coloured shape in that line rather than simply rotating it.":"Laini ti o wa ni aarin n ṣiṣẹ bi digi. Ṣe afihan apẹrẹ ti o ni awọ naa ni apa keji laini yẹn, dipo ki o kan yi i pada lasan.","The last mirror line is vertical, so the yellow shape is flipped left to right. Its colour and size remain unchanged.":"Laini digi ti o kẹhin wa ni inaro, nitorinaa apẹrẹ ofeefee naa yipada lati apa osi si apa ọtun. Awọ ati iwọn rẹ ko yipada.","Overlay the shapes and use the first colour":"Gbe awọn apẹrẹ naa le ara wọn lori, ki o si lo awọ ti apẹrẹ akọkọ.","Place both shapes on top of one another. Keep the combined silhouette and the visible outlines, but colour the result with the first shape’s colour.":"Gbe awọn apẹrẹ mejeeji le ara wọn lori. Jẹ ki apẹrẹ ti o ṣẹda lati inu idapọ wọn ati awọn laini ita rẹ han, ṣugbọn lo awọ ti apẹrẹ akọkọ fun gbogbo rẹ.","Overlay the blue downward triangle and the yellow hexagon, then use blue for the combined figure. The triangle’s projecting tips remain visible around the hexagon.":"Gbe onigun mẹta buluu ti o tọka si isalẹ le apẹrẹ onigun mẹfa ofeefee lori, lẹhinna lo awọ buluu fun apẹrẹ ti o ṣẹda lati inu idapọ wọn. Awọn igun onigun mẹta naa yoo tun han ni ayika onigun mẹfa naa.","Keep green in exactly one input":"Jẹ ki awọ alawọ ewe han ninu ọkan ninu awọn apẹrẹ ti a fiwewe nikan.","Compare corresponding areas of the two squares. An area is green if it is green in exactly one input. Green in both cancels to white; white in both stays white.":"Fi awọn apakan ti o baamu ninu awọn onigun mẹrin mejeeji wewe. Apakan kan yoo jẹ alawọ ewe ti o ba jẹ pe o jẹ alawọ ewe ninu ọkan ninu awọn apẹrẹ naa nikan. Ti o ba jẹ alawọ ewe ninu mejeeji, yoo di funfun; ti o ba jẹ funfun ninu mejeeji, yoo wa ni funfun.","The first square is entirely green and the second has only a green bottom-left quarter. That shared quarter turns white; the other three quarters stay green.":"Onigun mẹrin akọkọ jẹ alawọ ewe patapata, lakoko ti onigun mẹrin keji ni apakan alawọ ewe ni igun isalẹ apa osi nikan. Apa kan ninu awọn apa mẹrin ti a pin yii yoo di funfun; awọn apa mẹta yoku yoo wa ni awọ alawọ ewe.","Attach a copy at every corner":"Fi ẹda kan si igun kọọkan.","Put a copy of the small black symbol at each vertex of the large shape. The added copies take the large shape’s colour.":"Fi ẹda aami dudu kekere kan si igun kọọkan ti apẹrẹ nla naa. Awọn ẹda ti a fi kun yii yoo gba awọ ti apẹrẹ nla naa ni.","The large blue diamond has four corners. Add a blue downward triangle at each corner, following the same placement rule as the examples.":"Apẹrẹ nla onigun mẹrin ti o dabi okuta iyebiye (diamond) ti o ni awọ buluu ni awọn igun mẹrin. Fi onigun mẹta oniwọ buluu kan si igun kọọkan, ni titele ilana gbigbe kanna bii ti awọn apẹẹrẹ ti a fun.","Add corresponding bar heights":"Ṣafikun awọn giga ọwọn ti o baamu.","For each of the three horizontal positions, add the black bar’s height in the first picture to its height in the second. Measure upwards from the common bottom line.":"Fun ipo kọọkan ninu awọn ipo mẹta ti o wa ni itọsọna petele, ṣafikun giga ọwọn dudu ti o wa ninu aworan akọkọ pẹlu giga rẹ ninu aworan keji. Ṣe iwọn lati laini isalẹ ti o wọpọ lọ si oke.","Neither input has a left bar. The two middle bars add to a full-height bar, while the right bars add to a shorter bar. The answer has just those middle and right bars.":"Ko si ọwọn ni apa osi ninu awọn aworan mejeeji. Awọn ọwọn meji ti o wa ni aarin yoo papọ lati di ọwọn kan ti o ni giga kikun, nigba ti awọn ọwọn ti o wa ni apa ọtún yoo papọ lati di ọwọn kan ti o kuru ju. Idahun naa yoo ni awọn ọwọn ti aarin ati ti apa ọtún wọnyi nikan.","Rotate and alternate colours":"Yi pada ki o si paarọ awọn awọ.","Turn the shape 45 degrees counterclockwise at each step. Its colour alternates, so the third picture returns to the first picture’s colour.":"Yi apẹrẹ naa pada ni iwọn 45 ni ọna idakeji si ti aago ni igbesẹ kọọkan. Awọ rẹ n yipada leralera, nitorinaa awọ ti o wa ninu aworan kẹta jọ eyi ti o wa ninu aworan akọkọ.","Turn the white middle shape another 45 degrees counterclockwise and restore the dark colour from the first picture. Choose the dark curved shape in that orientation.":"Yi apẹrẹ funfun ti o wa ni aarin pada ni iwọn 45 miiran ni ọna idakeji si ti aago, ki o si mu awọ dudu ti o wa ninu aworan akọkọ pada wa. Yan apẹrẹ ti o tẹ ti o ni awọ dudu ni ipo yẹn.","Combine the black circles":"Papọ awọn iyika dudu naa.","A circle is black in the result whenever the matching circle is black in either input. It is white only when both inputs have a white circle there.":"Ninu abajade, iyika yoo jẹ dudu ti iyika ti o baamu pẹlu rẹ ba jẹ dudu ninu eyikeyi ninu awọn aworan ti a fiwewe. Yoo jẹ funfun nikan ti awọn iyika ti o wa ni ipo yẹn ninu awọn aworan mejeeji ba jẹ funfun.","The first input contributes the bottom-right black circle; the second contributes the two top black circles. The centre and bottom-left circle stay white.":"Aworan akọkọ pese iyika dudu ti o wa ni apa isalẹ ọtun; aworan keji pese awọn iyika dudu meji ti o wa ni oke. Iyika ti o wa ni aarin ati eyi ti o wa ni apa isalẹ osi wa ni funfun.","Expand into neighbouring cells":"Tan kaakiri si awọn apoti ti o wa nitosi.","At each step, every blue cell remains blue and also colours its immediate neighbours above, below, left and right. Expansion stops at the grid boundary.":"Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, gbogbo apoti ti o ni awọ buluu yoo wa ni buluu, yoo si tun fi awọ buluu kun awọn apoti ti o wa nitosi rẹ—ni oke, isalẹ, osi, ati ọtun. Itankale yii yoo duro ni opin aala ti akoj naa.","Apply the same one-cell expansion to the middle blue region. Newly reached side neighbours become blue; cells farther away remain in the grey-and-black checkerboard.":"Lo ọna itankale si awọn apoti ti o wa nitosi yii fun agbegbe buluu ti o wa ni aarin. Awọn apoti ti o wa nitosi ti o kan di buluu; awọn apoti ti o jinna si ibẹ yoo wa ni irisi onigun mẹrin ti o ni awọ grẹy ati dudu.","Cancel matching brown positions":"Yọ awọn ipo ti o ni awọ brown ti o baamu kuro.","Compare the two five-cell strips position by position. A cell is brown in the result if exactly one input is brown there. Matching brown cells cancel to blue.":"Fi awọn ila mejeeji ti o ni apoti marun-un kọọkan wewe, ni ipo kọọkan. Ninu abajade, apoti kan yoo ni awọ brown ti o ba jẹ pe ọkan ninu awọn ila naa nikan lo ni awọ brown ni ipo yẹn. Awọn apoti ti o ni awọ brown ti o baamu yoo yipada si awọ buluu.","Brown occurs in positions 2, 3, 4 and 5 in the first strip and in positions 2, 3 and 5 in the second. Only position 4 remains brown.":"Awọ brown wa ni awọn ipo 2, 3, 4, ati 5 ninu ila akọkọ, ati ni awọn ipo 2, 3, ati 5 ninu ila keji. Ipo 4 nikan ni yoo wa pẹlu awọ brown.","Remove the closest red dots":"Yọ awọn aami pupa ti o sunmọ ara wọn julọ kuro.","Find the smallest distance between any two red dots. Remove every red dot belonging to a pair at that distance. Recalculate the closest distance for the next step.":"Wa aaye ti o kere julọ laarin eyikeyi aami pupa meji. Yọ gbogbo aami pupa ti o jẹ apakan ti iru bata bẹẹ kuro. Tun ṣe iṣiro aaye ti o kere julọ fun igbesẹ ti o tẹle.","In the middle picture, the three lower red dots participate in the closest diagonal pairs. Removing them leaves only the red dot in the top row, fourth column.":"Ninu aworan ti o wa ni aarin, awọn aami pupa mẹta ti o wa ni isalẹ jẹ apakan ti awọn tọkọtaya ti o wa ni diagonal (ila ti o tẹ) ti o sunmọ julọ. Ti a ba yọ wọn kuro, aami pupa ti o wa ni ori ila oke, ni iwe kẹrin nikan ni yoo ku.","Move the six colours around a cycle":"Gbe awọn awọ mẹfa naa yika ninu iyipo kan.","Read down the left stack, then down the right stack. Shift every colour one position forward in that six-position cycle; the bottom-right colour wraps to the top left.":"Ka lati oke de isalẹ ni ẹgbẹ osi, lẹhinna ṣe bẹẹ ni ẹgbẹ ọtun. Gbe awọ kọọkan siwaju ni ipo kan ninu iyipo ti o ni awọn ipo mẹfa yẹn; awọ ti o wa ni isalẹ ọtun yoo lọ si oke osi.","From the middle picture, the bottom-right brown circle wraps to the top left. The final stacks are brown/red/red on the left and black/brown/blue on the right.":"Lati inu aworan ti o wa ni aarin, iyipo brown ti o wa ni isalẹ ọtun yoo lọ si oke osi. Awọn akojọpọ ti o kẹhin yoo jẹ brown/pupa/pupa ni apa osi, ati dudu/brown/buluu ni apa ọtun.","Move white and black in opposite directions":"Gbe awọ funfun ati dudu lọ si awọn itọsọna ti o lodi si ara wọn.","White circles move one corner clockwise and black circles move one corner counterclockwise at each step. Grey means that a white and a black circle occupy the same corner; separate them before moving again.":"Awọn iyipo funfun n lọ si igun kan ni itọsọna ti aago n lọ, lakoko ti awọn iyipo dudu n lọ si igun kan ni itọsọna ti o lodi si ti aago, ni igbesẹ kọọkan. Awọ grẹy tọka si pe iyipo funfun ati iyipo dudu wa ni igun kanna; ya wọn sọtọ ki o to tun gbe wọn lẹẹkansi.","The middle picture contains white circles at the two left corners and black circles at the two left corners and bottom right. Moving them gives white at top left, grey at top right, and black at both bottom corners.":"Aworan ti o wa ni aarin ni awọn iyipo funfun ni awọn igun meji ti apa osi, ati awọn iyipo dudu ni awọn igun meji ti apa osi pẹlu igun isalẹ ọtun. Nigba ti a ba gbe wọn, awọn iyipo funfun yoo wa ni oke osi, grẹy yoo wa ni oke ọtun, ati awọn iyipo dudu yoo wa ni awọn igun isalẹ mejeeji.","Extend every horizontal stroke":"Fa gbogbo awọn ila petele (horizontal strokes) naa gun siwaju.","At each step, extend each black horizontal stroke into the immediately neighbouring capsule on both sides. Existing strokes remain, and strokes stop at the outside edges.":"Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, fa ila petele dudu kọọkan gun siwaju sinu apoti (capsule) ti o wa nitosi rẹ ni ẹgbẹ mejeeji. Awọn ila ti o wa tẹlẹ yoo wa bi wọn ṣe wa, awọn ila naa yoo si duro ni awọn eti ita.","Extend the strokes in the middle picture one more capsule left and right. Keep separate stroke heights distinct; the answer shows the resulting longer horizontal lines across the four capsules.":"Fa awọn ila ti o wa ninu aworan aarin gun siwaju si apoti miiran ni apa osi ati ọtun. Rii daju pe awọn ila ti o ni giga oriṣiriṣi wa ni iyatọ si ara wọn; idahun naa fihan awọn ila petele ti o gun ju ti o wa kọja awọn apoti mẹrin naa.","Grow the triangular lattice":"Mu eto onigun mẹta (triangular lattice) naa gbooro sii.","Treat the drawing as a group of small triangles. At each step, add a small triangle just outside every exposed edge, keeping the existing triangles and their connecting lines.":"Wo aworan naa gẹgẹbi akojọpọ awọn onigun mẹta kekere. Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, ṣafikun onigun mẹta kekere kan ni ita eti kọọkan ti o wa ni ṣiṣi, lakoko ti o n ṣetọju awọn onigun mẹta ti o wa tẹlẹ ati awọn ila ti o so wọn pọ.","Grow the middle green cluster by one more layer of neighbouring triangles. The answer keeps the same triangular grid and adds the triangles along its outside edges.":"Mu ẹgbẹ awọn onigun mẹta alawọ ewe ti o wa ni aarin gbooro sii nipa fifi ipele miiran ti awọn onigun mẹta ti o wa nitosi kun un. Idahun naa ṣetọju akoj onigun mẹta kanna, o si ṣafikun awọn onigun mẹta si awọn eti ita rẹ.","Remove the marked vertices":"Yọ awọn igun ti a samisi kuro.","The brown dots identify vertices of the black polygon to remove. Connect the remaining vertices in their original order. Two remaining vertices produce a line segment.":"Awọn aami brown tọka si awọn igun ti apẹrẹ onigun-pupọ dudu ti o yẹ ki a yọ kuro. So awọn igun ti o ku pọ ni tito-tẹle-ara wọn ti atilẹba. Awọn igun meji ti o ku yoo ṣẹda laini kan.","Remove the top and left vertices marked by the brown dots. Only the two lower vertices remain, so the answer is the short horizontal line near the bottom right.":"Yọ awọn igun ti o wa ni oke ati apa osi ti a samisi pẹlu awọn aami brown kuro. Awọn igun meji ti o wa ni isalẹ nikan ni yoo ku; nitorinaa, idahun naa jẹ laini kukuru ti o dubulẹ ni isalẹ apa ọtun.","Toggle the dots at the outline’s corners":"Yi ipo awọn aami pada ni awọn igun ti ila ita apẹrẹ naa.","Match the black outline’s vertices to the 3-by-3 dot positions. At each vertex, remove an existing blue dot or add one if the position is empty. Other positions stay unchanged.":"Ṣe ibamu awọn igun ti ila ita dudu pẹlu awọn ipo aami ninu akoj 3-si-3. Ni igun kọọkan, yọ aami buluu ti o wa tẹlẹ kuro, tabi fi aami kun ti ipo naa ba ṣofo. Awọn ipo miiran yoo wa bi wọn ṣe wa tẹlẹ.","Toggle the four corner positions of the slanted outline. The result has blue dots at top left and top middle, middle middle and middle right, and all three bottom positions.":"Yi ipo awọn aami pada ni awọn igun mẹrin ti ila ita ti o tẹẹrẹ. Abajade yoo ni awọn aami buluu ni oke apa osi ati aarin oke, aarin-aarin ati aarin apa ọtun, pẹlu gbogbo awọn ipo mẹta ni isalẹ.","Remove the marked brick and its neighbours":"Yọ biriki ti a samisi kuro, pẹlu awọn biriki ti o wa nitosi rẹ.","First remove the red brick and every brick sharing an edge with it, then let unsupported bricks fall straight down. Repeat the same process with the yellow brick.":"Ni akọkọ, yọ biriki pupa kuro pẹlu gbogbo awọn biriki ti o ni eti ti o kan pẹlu rẹ; lẹhinna, jẹ ki awọn biriki ti ko ni atilẹyin ṣubu taara si isalẹ. Tun ilana kanna ṣe pẹlu biriki ofeefee naa.","After the red removal, the remaining bricks form the middle staircase. Removing the yellow brick and its touching neighbours leaves the upper blue brick, which falls to the bottom.":"Lẹ́yìn tí a bá yọ àwọn bíríkì pupa kúrò, àwọn bíríkì tó ṣẹ́kù yóò di àtẹ̀gùn àárín. Tí a bá yọ bíríkì ofeefee náà kúrò pẹ̀lú àwọn tó fọwọ́ kan án, bíríkì aláwọ̀-bulu tó wà lókè yóò ṣubú sí ìsàlẹ̀.","Cycle the layers and apply the colour mask":"Yí àwọn ìpele náà padà, kí o sì lo àpẹẹrẹ àwọ̀ (colour mask) náà.","Track the same three shapes. At each step the front shape goes to the back. For the final picture, keep the middle picture’s grey or black fills; its unfilled white shapes regain their colours from the first picture.":"Tẹ̀lé àwọn àpẹ́rẹ́ mẹ́ta kan náà. Ní ìgbésẹ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan, àpẹ́rẹ́ tó wà ní iwájú yóò lọ sí ẹ̀yìn. Fún àwòrán tó kẹ́yìn, pa àwọn apá tó ní àwọ̀ eérú tàbí dúdú mọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí wọ́n ṣe rí nínú àwòrán àárín; àwọn apá funfun tí kò ní àwọ̀ yóò sì padà ní àwọ̀ tí wọ́n ní nínú àwòrán àkọ́kọ́.","The grey hexagon comes to the front, the black horizontal capsule lies behind it, and the vertical capsule moves to the back. That white vertical capsule regains its original yellow colour.":"Àpẹ́rẹ́ oní-igun mẹ́fà (hexagon) tó ní àwọ̀ eérú yóò wá sí iwájú, àpẹ́rẹ́ oní-ìrísí kápsúlù dúdú tó dúró ní ìtọ́sọ́nà pẹlẹbẹ yóò wà lẹ́yìn rẹ̀, nígbà tí àpẹ́rẹ́ oní-ìrísí kápsúlù tó dúró ní ìtọ́sọ́nà dúró-róró yóò lọ sí ẹ̀yìn. Kápsúlù funfun tó dúró ní ìtọ́sọ́nà dúró-róró yẹn yóò padà ní àwọ̀ ofeefee tí ó ní ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀.","Use each circle’s colour to find its motion":"Lo àwọ̀ tí ó wà nínú yíká kọ̀ọ̀kan láti mọ bí ó ṣe ń yípadà tàbí gúnlẹ̀ sí ipò mìíràn.","Track each circle relative to the circle immediately around it. White moves 90 degrees clockwise, black moves 90 degrees counterclockwise, and red stays in the same relative position. Blue does not move. Apply these movements to every nested level.":"Tẹ̀lé yíká kọ̀ọ̀kan ní ìbámu pẹ̀lú yíká tó yí i ká. Èyí tó funfun yóò yí ní ìwọ̀n ìyí 90 sí ọ̀nà tí ọwọ́ aago ń lọ, èyí tó dúdú yóò yí ní ìwọ̀n ìyí 90 sí ọ̀nà òdìkejì sí ti ọwọ́ aago, nígbà tí èyí tó pupa yóò dúró sí ipò kan náà. Èyí tó jẹ́ aláwọ̀-bulu kò ní yípadà. Lo àwọn ìyípadà wọ̀nyí fún gbogbo ìpele tó wà nínú ara wọn.","The black circle moves from above the blue circle to its left. Red stays to the right inside black. The larger white circle moves from above red to its right; the smallest white circle moves from below the larger white circle to its left.":"Yíká dúdú náà yóò yí láti òkè yíká aláwọ̀-bulu lọ sí apá òsì rẹ̀. Yíká pupa yóò dúró sí apá ọ̀tún, nínú yíká dúdú náà. Yíká funfun tó tóbi jù yóò yí láti òkè yíká pupa lọ sí apá ọ̀tún rẹ̀; yíká funfun tó kéré jù yóò yí láti ìsàlẹ̀ yíká funfun tó tóbi jù lọ sí apá òsì rẹ̀.","Move colours along the connected routes":"Gbe awọn awọ lọ pẹlu awọn ọna ti o sopọ mọ wọn","The black links specify the routes along which the colours move. Follow each loop clockwise, moving each colour to the next connected position. A two-position route swaps its colours; unconnected dots stay put.":"Awọn laini dudu n tọka si awọn ọna ti awọn awọ gbọdọ gba lati lọ. Tẹle iyipo kọọkan ni itọsọna ti ọwọ aago, ki o si gbe awọ kọọkan lọ si ipo ti o tẹle ti o sopọ mọ ọ. Ni ọna ti o ni ipo meji, awọn awọ ti o wa nibẹ yoo paarọ ipo pẹlu ara wọn; awọn aami ti ko ni asopọ kankan yoo wa ni ipo wọn bi wọn ṣe wa tẹlẹ.","Swap the two top colours. On the lower loop, the left-middle blue moves to the centre and the right-middle red moves to the bottom left. The unconnected bottom-right red stays unchanged.":"Paarọ awọn awọ meji ti o wa ni oke. Lori iyipo ti o wa ni isalẹ, awọ buluu ti o wa ni aarin apa osi yoo lọ si aarin, lakoko ti awọ pupa ti o wa ni aarin apa ọtun yoo lọ si isalẹ apa osi. Awọ pupa ti o wa ni isalẹ apa ọtun, eyi ti ko ni asopọ pẹlu ohunkohun, yoo wa bi o ṣe wa.","Move each colour along its own path":"Gbe awọ kọọkan lọ ni ibamu pẹlu ọna tirẹ","Red moves down, green moves right and yellow moves left. Blue moves up and, where possible, one column left. White marks overlapping colours; separate those colours again when applying the next move. Colours moving beyond the grid disappear.":"Awọ pupa yoo lọ si isalẹ, awọ alawọ ewe yoo lọ si apa ọtun, ati awọ ofeefee yoo lọ si apa osi. Awọ buluu yoo lọ si oke, ati pe ti o ba ṣeeṣe, yoo lọ si apa osi pẹlu. Awọ funfun n tọka si ibi ti awọn awọ ti kojọpọ tabi dapọ mọ ara wọn; ya awọn awọ wọnyi sọtọ nigba ti o ba n ṣe igbesẹ ti o tẹle. Awọn awọ ti o ba kọja opin akoj naa yoo parẹ.","Separate the middle white cell into red and green. Red moves to bottom middle, green to middle right, blue reaches top left and yellow exits on the left. Those three coloured cells form the answer.":"Ya awọ funfun ti o wa ni aarin sọtọ si awọ pupa ati awọ alawọ ewe. Awọ pupa yoo lọ si aarin isalẹ, awọ alawọ ewe yoo lọ si aarin apa ọtun, awọ buluu yoo de oke apa osi, ati awọ ofeefee yoo jade lọ si apa osi. Awọn apakan awọ mẹta wọnyi ni o jẹ idahun si iṣoro naa.","Move red and blue tips in opposite directions":"Gbe awọn opin pupa ati buluu lọ si awọn itọsọna ti o lodi si ara wọn","At each step, every red tip moves one position counterclockwise and every blue tip moves two positions clockwise around the five-pointed star. White means that red and blue overlap; separate both colours before moving again.":"Ni igbesẹ kọọkan, gbogbo opin pupa yoo gbe ipo kan si itọsọna ti o lodi si ti aago (counterclockwise), ati pe gbogbo opin buluu yoo gbe awọn ipo meji si itọsọna ti aago (clockwise) ni ayika irawọ onigun marun. Awọ funfun tọka si pe pupa ati buluu ti wa ni ipo kanna (wọn ti dapọ); ya awọn awọ mejeeji sọtọ ki o to tun gbe wọn lẹẹkansi.","In the middle picture, red is at the lower right and blue is at the upper right and upper left. The next move puts red and one blue together at the upper right, making it white. The other blue moves to the lower left.":"Ninu aworan ti o wa ni aarin, pupa wa ni apa isalẹ ọtun, lakoko ti buluu wa ni apa oke ọtun ati apa oke osi. Igbesẹ ti o tẹle yoo mu pupa ati ọkan ninu awọn buluu wa papọ ni apa oke ọtun, eyi ti yoo jẹ ki o di funfun. Buluu keji yoo lọ si apa isalẹ osi.","Shift two copies in the sector’s directions":"Gbe awọn ẹda meji lọ si awọn itọsọna ti apakan (sector) naa tọka si","The two edges of the white sector indicate two movement directions. Make two copies of the red-dot pattern and shift one copy one grid step in each direction, wrapping at the edges. A position reached once is red; a position reached by both copies is blue.":"Awọn ẹgbẹ meji ti apakan funfun naa tọka si awọn itọsọna gbigbe meji. Ṣe awọn ẹda meji ti apẹrẹ ti o ni awọn aami pupa, ki o si gbe ẹda kọọkan lọ si itọsọna kọọkan ni aaye kan lori akoj (grid); ti o ba de opin, tẹsiwaju lati apa keji. Ipo ti a de lẹẹkan yoo jẹ pupa; ipo ti awọn ẹda mejeeji de yoo jẹ buluu.","The final sector points down-left and down-right. Shift a copy each way. Their overlap makes the entire top row and the centre blue; the single-copy positions remain red, as shown in the answer.":"Apakan ti o kẹhin tọka si isalẹ-osi ati isalẹ-ọtun. Gbe ẹda kan lọ si itọsọna kọọkan. Nibi ti wọn ti pade, gbogbo ila oke ati aarin yoo di buluu; awọn ipo ti ẹda kan ṣoṣo de yoo wa ni pupa, gẹgẹ bi a ti fihan ninu idahun naa.","Remove crossing string segments":"Yọ awọn apakan okun ti o kọja lori ara wọn kuro","Overlay both drawings. Treat each straight piece between successive grid dots as a separate string segment. When a segment from one drawing crosses a segment from the other between dots, remove both segments. Segments meeting at a grid dot stay. Keep all uncut segments from both drawings.":"Gbe awọn aworan mejeeji le ara wọn lori. Wo apakan laini taara kọọkan ti o wa laarin awọn aami akoj bi apakan okun lọtọ. Ti apakan kan lati inu aworan kan ba kọja lori apakan lati inu aworan keji laarin awọn aami, yọ awọn apakan mejeeji kuro. Awọn apakan ti o pade ni aami akoj yoo wa nibẹ. Jẹ ki gbogbo awọn apakan ti a ko ge lati inu awọn aworan mejeeji wa bi wọn ṣe wa.","Remove the diagonal segments cut between the grid dots. The remaining pieces form an upper fork with a vertical stem, two detached short diagonals near the top corners, and a lower fork with its own vertical stem.":"Yọ awọn apakan ti o tẹsi (diagonal) ti a ge laarin awọn aami akoj kuro. Awọn ege ti o ku yoo ṣẹda apẹrẹ bi orita ni oke pẹlu laini inaro, awọn ege kukuru meji ti o ya sọtọ nitosi awọn igun oke, ati apẹrẹ bi orita ni isalẹ pẹlu laini inaro tirẹ.","Slide and sort the pieces by size":"Fa awọn ege naa ki o si ṣeto wọn ni ibamu si iwọn wọn","Push all pieces in the arrow’s direction. Smaller pieces pass larger pieces and reach the furthest available spaces first. Keep every piece’s height and vertical position. Pieces may share a column if they do not overlap vertically; equal-sized pieces keep their relative order.":"Titari gbogbo awọn ege naa si itọsọna ti ọfa naa tọka si. Awọn ege ti o kere yoo kọja awọn ege ti o tobi ju wọn lọ, wọn yoo si de awọn aaye ti o jinna julọ ti o wa ni akọkọ. Ṣe itọju giga ati ipo inaro ti nkan kọọkan. Awọn nkan le wa ninu iwe (column) kan naa ti wọn ko ba bo ara wọn mọlẹ ni inaro; awọn nkan ti o ni iwọn dogba yoo wa ni tito-tẹle ti wọn wa tẹlẹ.","The arrow points right. Fit the shortest pieces into the available spaces on the right, then the two-cell pieces, then the taller pieces to their left. Nothing moves up or down, and no piece changes size.":"Ọfà naa tọka si apa ọtun. Gbe awọn nkan ti o kuru julọ si awọn aaye ti o wa ni apa ọtun, tẹle e pẹlu awọn nkan ti o ni apakan meji, lẹhinna gbe awọn nkan ti o ga julọ si apa osi wọn. Ko si nkan ti yoo lọ si oke tabi isalẹ, bẹẹ si ni ko si nkan ti yoo yipada iwọn rẹ.","Move the dividers into free spaces":"Gbe awọn ohun elo ipinya (dividers) naa si awọn aaye ti o ṣofo.","All black dividers simultaneously move one position to the right if the next position contains a yellow bead. A divider blocked by another divider waits. The right edge connects to the left edge.":"Gbogbo àwọn ìpín dúdú yóò gbe lọ sí apá ọ̀tún ní ìgbà kan náà, bí ipò tí ó tẹ̀lé wọn bá ní ilẹ̀kẹ̀ ofeefee kan. Tí ìpín kan bá ní ìdènà láti ọ̀dọ̀ ìpín mìíràn, yóò dúró. Ẹ̀gbẹ́ ọ̀tún so pọ̀ mọ́ ẹ̀gbẹ́ òsì.","Apply one simultaneous step to the middle sequence. The final order is divider, bead, divider, bead, divider, divider, bead.":"Ṣe ìgbésẹ̀ kan ní àkókò kan náà fún ìtò tí ó wà láàrin. Ètò tó kẹ́yìn yóò jẹ́: ìpín, ilẹ̀kẹ̀, ìpín, ilẹ̀kẹ̀, ìpín, ìpín, ilẹ̀kẹ̀.","Expand the colours and keep the largest group":"Mú kí àwọn àwọ̀ náà gbòòrò sí i, kí o sì pa ẹgbẹ́ tí ó tóbi jùlọ mọ́.","Replace every coloured ball with four new balls of the same colour, one step above, below, left and right. Balls leaving the grid disappear. At each position, keep the colour with the largest number of arriving balls. If colours tie for the largest number, leave the position empty. Several arrivals of the same colour appear as one coloured marker.":"Rọ́pò gbogbo bọ́ọ̀lù tí ó ní àwọ̀ pẹ̀lú bọ́ọ̀lù mẹ́rin tuntun tí wọ́n ní àwọ̀ kan náà; ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan wọn yóò wà ní òkè, ìsàlẹ̀, òsì, àti ọ̀tún. Àwọn bọ́ọ̀lù tí ó bá jáde kúrò nínú àwòrán oní-pẹ́lẹbẹ náà yóò pòórá. Ní ipò kọ̀ọ̀kan, pa àwọ̀ tí ó ní iye bọ́ọ̀lù tó pọ̀ jùlọ tí ó dé síbẹ̀ mọ́. Tí àwọn àwọ̀ bá ní iye tó dọ́gba fún èyí tó pọ̀ jùlọ, fi ipò náà sílẹ̀ láìsí ohunkóhun. Tí ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ bọ́ọ̀lù tí ó ní àwọ̀ kan náà bá dé sí ibì kan náà, wọ́n yóò hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí àmì àwọ̀ kan ṣoṣo.","Expanding the displayed middle picture leaves green at the top right and at row 2, column 3; red at row 2, column 1; and brown at row 2, column 2, row 3, column 3, and row 4, columns 2, 3 and 4. Those are exactly the colours and positions in the stored answer.":"Nígbà tí a bá mú kí àwòrán tí ó wà láàrin gbòòrò sí i, àwọ̀ ewé yóò wà ní òkè ní apá ọ̀tún, àti ní ìlà kejì, ọwọ̀n kẹta; àwọ̀ pupa yóò wà ní ìlà kejì, ọwọ̀n kìíní; àwọ̀ kọfí yóò sì wà ní ìlà kejì, ọwọ̀n kejì; ìlà kẹta, ọwọ̀n kẹta; àti ìlà kẹrin, àwọn ọwọ̀n kejì, kẹta, àti kẹrin. Àwọn wọ̀nyí gan-an ni àwọn àwọ̀ àti ipò tí ó wà nínú ìdáhùn tí a ti fipamọ́ sílẹ̀.","Choose language":"Yan èdè","Search languages":"Wá àwọn èdè","Close language selector":"Pa aṣayan ede","No languages found":"A ko ri ede kankan","Free IQ test for fun | IQ Champion":"Idanwo IQ ọfẹ fun igbadun | IQ Champion","A free IQ-style test for fun: 36 visual puzzles, 40 minutes, saved progress and an estimated IQ result. No account needed.":"Idanwo ọfẹ ti o dabi idanwo IQ fun igbadun: awọn ibeere wiwo 36, iṣẹju 40, ifipamọ ilọsiwaju, ati iṣiro abajade IQ rẹ. Ko nilo ṣiṣẹda akọọlẹ.","Choose your preferred language. Your answers and original deadline stay saved.":"Yan ede ti o fẹ. Awọn idahun rẹ ati akoko ipari atilẹba yoo wa ni ipamọ.","Loading language…":"N gbe ede wọle…","The language could not be loaded. Your test and answers are unchanged.":"A ko le gbe ede naa wọle. Idanwo ati awọn idahun rẹ ko yipada.","Feedback is available in Danish and English.":"Àwọn èsì wà ní èdè Danish àti èdè Gẹ̀ẹ́sì.","Shared achievement":"Àṣeyọrí tí a pín","Shared result":"Èsì tí a pín","Shared results are self-reported.":"Àwọn èsì tí a pín jẹ́ èyí tí ẹni náà fúnra rẹ̀ sọ.","Shared achievements are self-reported. No age, country, answers or personal profiles are shared.":"Àwọn àṣeyọrí tí a pín jẹ́ èyí tí ẹni náà fúnra rẹ̀ sọ. A kò pín ọjọ́-orí, orílẹ̀-èdè, àwọn ìdáhùn, tàbí àlàyé nípa ẹni náà.","Try the 36 puzzles yourself":"Gbìyànjú àwọn ìṣòro ọpọlọ 36 náà fúnra rẹ","Try the test yourself":"Gbìyànjú ìdánwò náà fúnra rẹ","A visual challenge in IQ Champion. Can you spot the pattern too?":"Ìpèníjà tó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú rírí nǹkan ní IQ Champion. Ṣé o lè rí ìlànà náà pẹ̀lú?","A free visual puzzle test, just for fun. Not a professionally validated IQ measurement.":"Ìdánwò ìṣòro ọpọlọ tó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú rírí nǹkan, ó jẹ́ ọ̀fẹ́, ó sì wà fún ìgbádùn lásán. Kì í ṣe ọ̀nà ìwọ̀n IQ tí àwọn ògbógi ti fọwọ́ sí.","Page not found":"A kò rí ojú-ewé náà","You can continue in another language.":"O lè tẹ̀síwájú ní èdè mìíràn.","answered":"tí a ti dáhùn","unanswered":"tí a kò dáhùn","correct":"tí ó tọ́","incorrect":"kò tọ́","IQ Champion":"IQ Champion","IQCHAMPION":"IQCHAMPION","English":"English","Dansk":"Dansk","Privacy":"Ìpamọ́"},"templates":{"Estimated median range: {0} ({1} timed correct answers).":"Àyè àárín tí a fojú díwọ̀n: {0} (àwọn ìdáhùn tó tọ́ tí a gba àkókò fún: {1}).","Question {0} · {1}":"Ìbéèrè {0} · {1}","{0} correct patterns":"{0} àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tó tọ́","Active time: {0}":"Àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́: {0}","Comparison: {0} voluntary attempts over {1} days.":"Àfiwé: {0} ìgbìyànjú tí a ṣe ní ti ara ẹni láàárín ọjọ́ {1}.","Question {0} / {1}":"Ìbéèrè {0} / {1}","Review question {0} / {1}":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò ìbéèrè {0} / {1}","Row {0}, icon {1}":"Ìlà {0}, àmì {1}","Answer {0}":"Ìdáhùn {0}","Question {0}, {1}":"Ìbéèrè {0}, {1}","Review question {0}, {1}":"Àtúnyẹ̀wò ìbéèrè {0}, {1}","{0} correct; {1} incorrect; {2} unanswered.":"{0} tó tọ́; {1} tí kò tọ́; {2} tí a kò dáhùn.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered.":"{0} tí a dáhùn; {1} tí a kò dáhùn.","{0} answered; {1} unanswered. Unanswered questions count as incorrect. Once finished, you cannot change answers.":"{0} tí a dáhùn; {1} tí a kò dáhùn. Àwọn ìbéèrè tí a kò dáhùn ni a kà sí àwọn tí kò tọ́. Nígbà tí o bá parí, o kò lè yí àwọn ìdáhùn padà mọ́.","{0} / {1} correct":"{0} / {1} tó tọ́","Percentile among historical participants: {0}":"Ipò nínú ìpín ọgọ́rùn-ún (percentile) láàárín àwọn tó ti kópa tẹ́lẹ̀: {0}","Participants scoring lower: {0}%. Participants with the same score: {1}%.":"Àwọn tó kópa tí wọ́n ní àmì tó kéré sí èyí: {0}%. Àwọn tó kópa tí wọ́n ní àmì tó dọ́gba pẹ̀lú èyí: {1}%.","Reference group: {0} historical attempts. Attempts with recorded durations over one minute and up to 40 minutes are included. Tied scores share the midpoint of their percentile group. Estimates are rounded to whole numbers and displayed only within 55–145, with a limit indicator outside that range. This is a scale conversion, not an independently validated population IQ measurement. Practice and repeated attempts can affect your result. Some example images have been corrected since the historical attempts were collected, which limits comparability.":"Ẹgbẹ́ ìfiwéra: {0} ìgbìyànjú láti àkókò tó ti kọjá. Àwọn ìgbìyànjú tí ó gba àkókò tó ju ìṣẹ́jú kan lọ, títí dé ìṣẹ́jú 40, wà nínú èyí. Àwọn tí wọ́n ní àmì tó dọ́gba yóò pín àyè àárín nínú ẹgbẹ́ ìpín ọgọ́rùn-ún wọn. Àwọn àbájáde tí a fojú díwọ̀n wọ̀nyí ni a yí padà sí nọ́mbà odidi, a sì fi wọ́n hàn láàárín 55 sí 145 nìkan; àmì kan yóò sì fi hàn bí ó bá kọjá ààlà yẹn. Èyí jẹ́ ìyípadà ìwọ̀n, kì í ṣe ìwọ̀n IQ olùgbé tí a ti fìdí rẹ̀ múlẹ̀ lọ́nà míràn. Ṣíṣe àtúnyẹ̀wò àti gbígbìyànjú ní ọ̀pọ̀ ìgbà lè ní ipa lórí àbájáde rẹ. Àwọn àwòrán àpẹẹrẹ kan ti ní àtúnṣe láti ìgbà tí a ti kó àwọn ìgbìyànjú àtijọ́ jọ, èyí sì mú kí ó ṣòro láti fi wé wọn pẹ̀lú ara wọn.","My estimated IQ in IQ Champion: {0}. Just for fun. Try it: {1}":"Àbájáde IQ mi nínú IQ Champion jẹ́: {0}. Fún eré lásán ni. Gbìyànjú rẹ̀: {1}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1}. Can you do it too? {2}":"Mo yanjú ìbéèrè {0} lọ́nà tó tọ́ láàárín {1}. Ṣé o lè ṣe é pẹ̀lú? {2}","I solved question {0} correctly in {1} (estimated median among correct answers: {2}). Can you do it too? {3}":"Mo yanjú ìbéèrè {0} lọ́nà tó tọ́ láàárín {1} (àárín gbùngbùn àwọn ìdáhùn tó tọ́ jẹ́: {2}). Ṣé o lè ṣe é pẹ̀lú? {3}","I found {0} correct patterns in IQ Champion. Try it: {1}":"Mo rí àwọn àpẹẹrẹ {0} tó tọ́ nínú IQ Champion. Gbìyànjú rẹ̀: {1}","Can you find the missing patterns in IQ Champion? {0}":"Ṣé o lè rí àwọn àpẹẹrẹ tó kù nínú IQ Champion? {0}","Question {0} solved":"A ti yanjú ìbéèrè {0}","{0} patterns solved":"A ti yanjú àwọn àpẹẹrẹ {0}","{0} / 36 correct. {1}":"{0} / 36 tó tọ́. {1}","Estimated IQ {0} | IQ Champion":"Àbájáde IQ {0} | IQ Champion"},"status":"translated"};
